    "**FreeGrid Pro**：对比免费版和 Pro，开始免费体验、购买或恢复购买。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "**FreeGrid Pro**: compare free and Pro, start the free trial, buy, or restore a purchase."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "**Pro** 有贷款时，还款日那一格中间打一个孔；最后那个淡色带孔的格子，是钱撑不到的下一次还款。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "**Pro** With loans, the cell on each payment day has a hole in it; the last faded cell with a hole is the next payment your money won't reach."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "**Pro** 现金拆成多个账户时，可以选从哪个账户扣、存进哪个账户。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "**Pro** With cash split into accounts, choose which account pays or receives."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "**Pro**：每个资产项前面的方格、每个现金账户前面的序号，都是它自己的开关。新加的默认计入。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "**Pro**: the square next to each asset item and the number next to each cash account are their own switches. New ones count by default."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "**下次固定支出**：最近一笔房租、订阅或月供还有几天扣。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "**Next**: days until your next rent, subscription or loan payment comes out."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "**今日对比长条**：今天的日常支出和日常日均比，房租这类固定支出不算在内。它和小卡一样能拖、能移除，只是总占一整行。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "**Today bar**: today's everyday spending against your everyday average; fixed expenses like rent aren't included. You can drag and remove it like the cards; it just always takes a full row."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "**今日花销**：今天的日常支出，比日常日均高还是低。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "**Today**: today's everyday spending, above or below your everyday average."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "**从 JSON 导入**：写入前先看预览，重复的跳过，资产和现金怎么处理由你选。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "**Import from JSON**: preview before anything is written; duplicates are skipped, and you choose what happens to assets and cash."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "**从已有的拆出**：把已记的钱分一部分出来，总数不变。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "**Split from existing**: move part of money you've already recorded; the total stays the same."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "**修改**：点一行，改金额、分类、日期或备注。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "**Edit**: tap a row to change the amount, category, date or note."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "**免费**：「资产」前面的方格是开关，选资产整体计不计入。现金总是计入。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "**Free**: the square next to “Assets” is a switch for whether assets count as a whole. Cash always counts."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "**净值** = 资产 + 现金，自动算出。点一行改金额。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "**Net worth** = assets + cash, calculated for you. Tap a row to change an amount."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "**可动用资产**：算进自由天数的现金和资产一共多少，小字是资产和现金各占几成。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "**Funds**: the cash and assets that count toward Freedom Days. The small text shows how much is assets and how much is cash."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "**固定支出**（免费）：房租、水电、会员。填每次付多少、几个月付一次、下次哪天付。几个月付一次的，填那一次付的总数。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "**Fixed expenses** (free): rent, utilities, subscriptions. Enter how much each payment is, how often, and the next due date. For bills every few months, enter the full amount of one payment."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "**固定支出按付款日扣**。房租、水电、会员这类定期付的钱，在钱包里设好金额、周期和下次付款日。推算时到哪天扣哪笔，到期自动记账。因为早已算进去，交房租那天数字不会突然掉一大截。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "**Fixed expenses come out on their due dates.** For rent, utilities and subscriptions, set the amount, how often, and the next due date in Assets. The projection takes each one out on its day and records it automatically. Because it's already counted, the number won't suddenly drop on rent day."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "**外观**：主题（浅色、深色、跟随系统）、首页大数字的位置、钱包页的样式。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "**Appearance**: theme (light, dark or system), where the big number sits on the Dashboard, and the style of the Assets page."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "**导出 CSV**：用 Excel、Numbers 看的流水表，**不能导回**。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "**Export CSV**: a transaction list for Excel or Numbers. It **can't be imported back**."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "**导出 JSON**：完整备份，能导回 FreeGrid。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "**Export JSON**: a complete backup you can import back into FreeGrid."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "**我的目标**（Pro）：桌面小号、中号，锁屏圆形和长条。写着还差多少天自由，定了日子的倒数还有几天。长按点「编辑小组件」选看哪个目标。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "**My goal** (Pro): small and medium on the Home Screen, circular and rectangular on the Lock Screen. Shows how many Freedom Days you still need, and counts down if the goal has a date. Touch and hold, then tap \"Edit Widget\" to choose the goal."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "**我的自由卡**：30 天银卡，180 天香槟金，1 年黑卡；被动收入覆盖全部开销是 ∞ 卡。卡上只写天数，不写金额。**Pro** 可以导出成卡片或海报分享。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "**My Freedom Card**: Silver at 30 days, Champagne at 180, Black at 1 year, and the ∞ card when passive income covers all spending. It shows days, never amounts. **Pro** exports it as a card or poster to share."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "**扣款顺序**：记支出时，从排在最前、钱够的现金账户整笔扣。按住右边的三道横线拖动，调整顺序。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "**Payment order**: an expense comes out in full from the first cash account that can cover it. Drag the three lines on the right to reorder."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "**撤销**：向左滑一行，点「撤销」。确认前会告诉你现金会怎么变。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "**Undo**: swipe a row left and tap “Undo”. Before you confirm, it tells you how cash will change."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "**收入到账、攒下钱**：自由天数变多，格子点亮。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "**Income and savings**: Freedom Days go up and cells light up."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "**新增的钱**：之前没记过的钱，总数变多。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "**New money**: money you hadn't recorded before; the total goes up."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "**日均**：平均每天花多少。小字拆成「日常 · 固定」，固定是固定支出折成的每天。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "**Daily**: what you spend per day on average. The small text splits it into “everyday · fixed”, where fixed is your fixed expenses per day."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "**本月花销**：本月 1 号到今天花了多少，和上个月同一段比。自动扣的房租、月供也算在内。点它去明细，看这个月钱花在哪。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "**Month**: what you've spent from the 1st to today, compared with the same days last month. Automatic rent and loan payments are included. Tap it to open History and see where this month's money went."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "**查找**：右上角搜索金额或备注。先在卡片里展开、点中一类再搜，就只在这一类里找。**Pro**：搜到的支出可以一起移到别的分类，比如点「其他」、搜「咖啡」，把它们移到新建的「咖啡」。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "**Find**: search amounts or notes at the top right. Expand the card and tap a category first to search only within it. **Pro**: move the expenses you find to another category together, for example tap Other, search “coffee”, and move them to a new Coffee category."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "**浏览**：按月看，按天分组。点月份打开月度汇总：每个月的收入、支出、净，点开一个月看支出构成，柱状图和扇形图可以切换；从这里可以跳到任意一个月；旁边的箭头前后翻月。首页点「本月花销」也会来到这个月。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "**Browse**: by month, grouped by day. Tap the month for the monthly summary: income, spending and net for every month; open a month to see its spending by category as a bar or pie chart, and jump to any month from there; the arrows go back and forward. Tapping the Month card on the Dashboard also brings you here."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "**清空记账数据**：不能撤销。清空前先导出 JSON。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "**Erase ledger data**: can't be undone. Export JSON first."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "**现金**（蓝色）：随时能花的钱，比如活期、微信、支付宝。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "**Cash** (blue): money you can spend any time, like a checking account or a payment app."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "**目标长条**（Pro）：每个自己的目标都能放一条，没加时不在首页上，想天天看的从「还可以添加」加进来。左边是现在的自由天数和目标，右边是还差多少；定了日子的，下面写还有几天。点它改这个目标，和自检里「我的目标」是同一份。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "**Goal bars** (Pro): each of your goals can have a bar. They're not on the home screen until you add them from \"More Cards\". The left shows your Freedom Days now against the goal, the right how many you still need; with a date, the line below counts down the days left. Tap one to edit that goal; it's the same goal as in Freedom Check."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "**算哪些钱，你来定**。房子、长期投资、暂时不动的储蓄，可以不计入自由天数：它们仍算在净值里，但不算进可动用资产。免费版按资产整体选；**Pro** 可以逐个资产项、逐个现金账户选。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "**You decide which money counts.** A home, long-term investments or savings you won't touch can be left out of Freedom Days: they still count toward net worth, but not toward available funds. The free version decides for assets as a whole; **Pro** decides per asset item and per cash account."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "**自由天数**：按现在的钱和花法，你的钱预计还能撑多少天。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "**Freedom Days**: how many days your money would last at your current spending."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "**自由天数**：桌面小号；锁屏圆形、长条，以及日期旁边的一行。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "**Freedom Days**: small on the Home Screen; circular, rectangular, and the line next to the date on the Lock Screen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "**自由看板**（Pro）：桌面中号，自由天数旁边放两项数字。长按小组件点「编辑小组件」，从日均、本月花销、记账天数这些里面选。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "**Freedom Dashboard** (Pro): medium on the Home Screen, with two numbers next to your Freedom Days. Touch and hold the widget, tap \"Edit Widget\", and pick from daily average, this month's spending, days tracked and more."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "**花钱**：自由天数变少，格子熄灭。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "**Spending**: Freedom Days go down and cells go dark."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "**被动收入覆盖**：被动收入能覆盖多少开销。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "**Passive**: how much of your spending passive income covers."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "**被动收入覆盖全部开销**（日常加固定）：钱不再被消耗，自由天数显示 **∞**。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "**Passive income covers all spending** (everyday plus fixed): your money is no longer being used up, and Freedom Days shows **∞**."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "**记账初期，大额支出摊开算**。记账不满 90 天时，单笔特别大的支出（比如刚开始记账就买的电脑）按 90 天摊进日均。满 90 天后，日均就是支出总额 ÷ 记账天数。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "**Early on, big purchases are spread out.** Until you've tracked for 90 days, an unusually large expense (like a laptop bought in your first week) is spread over 90 days in the daily average. After 90 days, the daily average is simply total spending ÷ days tracked."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "**记账天数**：从第一笔支出到今天。不满 90 天时写着再记多少天，日均趋势会更清晰。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "**Track**: days from your first expense to today. Before day 90, it shows how many more days until your daily average settles."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "**语言**：在外观卡的「语言」里选中文或 English，当场切换。没选过时跟 iOS 的语言走。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "**Language**: pick 中文 or English under “Language” in the Appearance card, and the app switches right away. Until you pick one, FreeGrid follows your iOS language."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "**财富自由自检**：按你的账自动判断九个里程碑，分记录、自由天数、现金流三组，点组名可以收起。点进去看每一项还差多少；点「每月有结余」可以填每月到手收入，不填按近 90 天的收入记录。最下面可以加自己的目标（Pro，个数不限）：想要多少天自由，再选一个截止日（可不选），比如攒够半年的应急金，或者给 GAP 定个日子。目标直接和首页的自由天数比，写着现在多少、还差多少；不算进里程碑。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "**Freedom Check**: nine milestones worked out from your ledger, in three groups (record, Freedom Days, cash flow); tap a group's name to collapse it. Tap in to see how far each one is. Tap \"Saving every month\" to add your monthly take-home pay; leave it blank to use your last 90 days of income. At the bottom you can add as many goals of your own as you like (Pro): how many Freedom Days you want, plus an optional date, like a six-month emergency fund or a date for your gap. Goals are compared straight with the Freedom Days on the home screen, showing where you are and how many you still need; they don't count toward the milestones."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "**账本**：支出分类、备份与恢复。免费版是默认九类；**Pro** 可以添加分类、配图标、改名、排序；点一个分类 →「全部 N 笔移到…」，把它的账并进另一个分类。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "**Ledger**: expense categories, backup and restore. The free version has the nine defaults; **Pro** lets you add, give icons to, rename and reorder categories. Tap a category → “Move All N Entries To…” to merge its entries into another one."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "**贷款**（Pro）：房贷、车贷、分期。填每月还多少、几号还、还剩几期。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "**Loans** (Pro): mortgages, car loans, installments. Enter the monthly payment, the due day and how many payments are left."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "**资产**（金色）：短期不打算花的钱，比如定期、股票、基金、房子。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "**Assets** (gold): money you don't plan to spend soon, like deposits, stocks, funds or a home."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "**避免重复算**：添加时，如果以前手动记过同样金额的支出，App 会找出来。核对后勾上的，不再算进日均。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "**No double counting**: when you add one, FreeGrid finds past expenses you entered by hand with the same amount. The ones you check no longer count toward the daily average."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "**金色**来自资产，**蓝色**来自现金。有钱没计入时，图例旁会写出来。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "**Gold** comes from assets, **blue** from cash. If some money isn't counted, the legend says so."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "**钱花在哪**：点月份卡片下面的「展开 N 类」，按金额从多到少列出各类支出，后面写着相当于平时几天的开销。自动扣的房租、月供合成「固定支出」一行，收入单列在最后。点一类，下面只留这一类的记录；再点一下，或点「看全部」，回到全部。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "**Where it went**: tap “Show N categories” at the bottom of the month card to list your spending by category, largest first, with how many days of your usual spending each one equals. Automatic rent and loan payments share one Fixed Expenses row, and income comes last. Tap a category to see only its entries; tap it again, or tap “Show all”, to go back."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/%lld": {},
    "/月": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "/mo"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "0": {},
    "0.00": {},
    "1 年": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "1 year"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "180 天": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "180 days"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "24": {},
    "30 天": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "30 days"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "< 0.1 天": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "< 0.1 days"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "CSV 用 Excel / Numbers 打开看；JSON 用来备份和恢复记账数据，外观这类本机设置要重新选": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "CSV opens in Excel or Numbers. JSON backs up and restores your ledger; device settings like appearance aren't included"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Export · 导出": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Export"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "FREEDOM CARD": {},
    "FREEDOM DAYS · 自由天数": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "FREEDOM DAYS"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "FREEGRID": {},
    "FREEGRID · APP STORE 搜 FREEGRID": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "FREEGRID · ON THE APP STORE"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Flow · 现金流": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
