    "「出」是房租、会员这类固定支出，和房贷、车贷。\n到日子自动记一笔，自由天数会提前留出这笔钱。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "“Out” is fixed expenses like rent and subscriptions, plus mortgages and car loans.\nThey're recorded on their dates, and Freedom Days sets the money aside in advance."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "「账本」里管支出分类和备份。\n换手机前，先在这里导出一份 JSON 备份。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "“Ledger” holds expense categories and backups.\nBefore switching phones, export a JSON backup here."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "「进」是租金、利息这类不靠上班的收入。\n它覆盖开销时，首页显示 ∞。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "“In” is income that doesn't need work, like rent you receive or interest.\nWhen it covers your spending, the Dashboard shows ∞."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "一个总数": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "One total"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "一年": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "one year"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "一格是一天自由；天数多了，一格换成一月或一年。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Each cell is one day of freedom; as the number grows, a cell becomes a month or a year."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "一格是一天；天数多了，会换成一月或一年。\n金色来自资产，蓝色来自现金，钱花掉格子就少。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Each cell is a day; with more days, a cell becomes a month or a year.\nGold comes from assets, blue from cash. Spending turns cells off."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "一次买断，永久使用": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pay once, yours forever"
          }
        }
      }
    },
