          }
        }
      }
    },
    "下次固定支出": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Next fixed expense"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "下面几张卡，点卡头抽出来，再点一下收回。\n「外观」里换深浅色、首页大数字的位置和钱包页的样式。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tap a card's header below to pull it out, and again to put it back.\n“Appearance” sets light or dark, where the big number sits, and the Assets page style."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "不会。账本只存在本机，没有账号、没有埋点。只有购买和恢复 Pro 时经过 Apple。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No. Your ledger stays on this device, with no account and no tracking. Only buying and restoring Pro go through Apple."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "不会，所有记账数据都保留。只是：": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No. All your ledger data stays. Only:"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "不再自动记账，也不计入自由天数。免费版不支持贷款，建议删除；已记的还款保留在明细里。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No more automatic records, and not counted in Freedom Days. The free version doesn't support loans, so deleting them is recommended; recorded payments stay in History."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "不到 1 年按天显示，1 到 10 年按月，10 年以上按年。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Under 1 year it's shown in days, from 1 to 10 years in months, and over 10 years in years."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "不填就按近 90 天的收入记录，每月约 ¥%@": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Leave blank to use your last 90 days of income: about ¥%@ a month"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "不打算马上花的钱：定期、股票、基金、房子": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Money you won't spend soon: deposits, stocks, funds, a home"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "不是每一笔钱都打算现在动用。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Not every dollar is meant to be spent now."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "不用。在钱包加上这笔固定支出，以后到日子自动记。添加时 App 会找出以前手记的同样金额的支出，核对后可以不再算进日均。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No. Add rent as a fixed expense in Assets and it will be recorded on its date from now on. While adding it, FreeGrid finds past expenses with the same amount; check them and they stop counting toward the daily average."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "不计入": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Not counted"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "不计入的仍在净值里，只是不进自由天数。新加的子账户默认计入。免费版只能整体选资产计不计入，现金总是计入。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Money left out is still part of net worth; it just isn't in Freedom Days. New sub-accounts count by default. The free version decides for assets as a whole, and cash always counts."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "不计入的钱仍算在净值里，只是不进自由天数。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Money that isn't counted is still part of net worth; it just doesn't go into Freedom Days."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "不计入自由天数": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Not counted in Freedom Days"
          }
        }
      }
