    "不靠上班、预计能一直到账的钱，填一次到账的总数": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Money that arrives without work and you expect to keep coming. Enter the full amount of one payment"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "不靠上班、预计能一直到账的钱，按每月的金额填": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
