            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Net"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "净 %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Net %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "净值": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Net worth"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "净值 = 资产 + 现金。\n下面这条线一段是一个账户，点一段跳到它那一边。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Net worth = assets + cash.\nEach segment of the bar is an account; tap one to jump to it."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "净值 = 资产 + 现金，自动相加。\n下面这条线里，金色是资产，蓝色是现金。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Net worth = assets + cash, added up for you.\nIn the bar below, gold is assets and blue is cash."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "净值、资产和现金是什么": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "What net worth, assets and cash mean"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "净值下面那条线按账户分段，点一段跳到对应的资产或现金。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The bar under net worth is split by account; tap a segment to jump to it."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "净值不等于资产加现金": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Net worth doesn't equal assets plus cash"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "净值已替换为 ¥%@": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Net worth replaced with ¥%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "净值是你记下的资产加现金，自动算出来，没有扣掉还没还完的贷款。其中计入自由天数的部分叫可动用资产，自由天数按它算。资产（金色）是不打算马上花的钱，比如定期、股票；现金（蓝色）是随时能花的钱。记收入进现金，记支出从现金扣；两者之间挪钱用「调拨」。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Net worth is the assets plus cash you've recorded, calculated for you, without subtracting loans you still owe. The part you count toward Freedom Days is your available funds, and Freedom Days are worked out from it. Assets (gold) are money you won't spend soon, like deposits and stocks; cash (blue) is money you can spend any time. Income goes into cash and expenses come out of it; use “Transfer” to move money between the two."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "净值未变动": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Net worth unchanged"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "几个月付一次": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "How often"
          }
        }
      }
    },
