    "刚开始记账时日均还不准，数字会跳得厉害。记一两周就会稳定。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When you first start, the daily average isn't reliable yet and the number jumps around. It settles after a week or two."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "删了 App，账本就没了。卸载、重装、换手机前，先导出 JSON 备份。": {
