    "到": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "To"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "到日子在 App 里自动记一笔，从现金扣，不会动你的银行卡。自由天数会把每期的钱先留出来。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Each payment is recorded in the app on its date and taken from cash. Your bank card is never touched. Freedom Days sets each payment aside in advance."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "到日子自动记一笔支出，之后每月 %lld 日一次": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "An expense is recorded on the date, then on day %lld of every month"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "到期那天「%@」余额不够，没有自动扣。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "“%@” didn't have enough on the due date, so it wasn't taken."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "到期那天整笔扣第一个够付的账户": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "On the due date, it comes out in full from the first account that can cover it"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "到期那天现金不够，没有自动扣。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cash was short on the due date, so it wasn't taken."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "到期那天自动记一笔支出，从现金扣。**只是在 App 里记账，不会动你的银行卡，也不会替你还款。**": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "On the due date an expense is recorded and taken from cash. **It's only a record in the app. It never touches your bank card or pays anything for you.**"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "剩余期数请填 1–%lld 之间的整数。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Enter a whole number of payments from 1 to %lld."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "加一个自己的目标": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Add a goal of your own"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "加了被动收入，余额怎么没变？": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I added passive income. Why didn't my balance change?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "加进现金": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Add to cash"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "勾上的不再另算进日均消费（固定支出已经折进去了），记录照样留在明细里。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Checked ones stop counting toward the daily average separately (the fixed expense already covers them). They stay in History."
          }
        }
