            "state": "translated",
            "value": "half a year"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "单位": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Unit"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "占一整行 · 今天和日常比": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Full row · today vs. everyday"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "卡的材质跟着自由天数变：30 天银卡，180 天香槟金，1 年黑卡；被动收入覆盖全部开销是 ∞ 卡。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The card changes with your Freedom Days: Silver at 30 days, Champagne at 180, Black at 1 year, and the ∞ card when passive income covers all spending."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "即使肩负还款责任，也能更清楚地了解自己的财务状况，以及当下真正拥有多少自由。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Even while paying things off, you get a clearer view of where you stand, and how much freedom you really have today."
          }
        }
      }
    },
