    "可以。在购买页点「免费体验 7 天」，Pro 全部打开。每个 Apple 账户一次，到期自动回到免费版，**不会自动扣费**。买断优惠价在开启体验后保留 14 天，之后恢复原价；没开启过体验的，直接买也是优惠价。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Yes. Tap “Try free for 7 days” on the Pro page and everything in Pro opens up. One trial per Apple Account; when it ends you're back on the free version, **with no automatic charge**. The discounted one-time price is held for 14 days after you start the trial, then returns to the regular price. If you never start a trial, buying directly also gets the discounted price."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "可以先体验 Pro 吗？": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Can I try Pro first?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "可以在自检里查看，修改需 Pro；首页的目标卡已收起。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
