    "在桌面或锁屏上长按空白处，点「编辑」→「添加小组件」，找到 FreeGrid。小组件上的数和首页一样，每天零点自己往前走；记了账，回到桌面就会更新。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Touch and hold an empty spot on your Home Screen or Lock Screen, tap \"Edit\" → \"Add Widget\", and find FreeGrid. Widgets show the same numbers as the Dashboard and move on by themselves at midnight; after you record something, they update when you go back to the Home Screen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "在自检里加一个目标，这里就会显示。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Add a goal in Freedom Check and it will show up here."
