            "value": "Deposit to"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "它不是「可动用资产 ÷ 月开销」。日均是记账以来的平均，不满 90 天时大额支出会摊开；被动收入从每天的消耗里减掉；固定支出和贷款按日历扣；不计入的钱不算。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "It isn't “available funds ÷ monthly spending”. The daily average covers everything since you started, with big purchases spread out in the first 90 days; passive income is subtracted from daily spending; fixed expenses and loans come out on their dates; and money you've excluded isn't counted."
          }
        }
      }
    },
