            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Emergency fund"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "底部的卡片放哪些、什么顺序由你定。在首页上按住一张卡，浮起来后拖到想放的位置。点一张卡（「本月花销」除外），或点下面的「编辑卡片」，打开编辑面板：上面是首页上的卡，点左边的减号移除，按住右边的把手也能拖动换顺序；移除的卡回到下面「还可以添加」，点加号加回来，也可以「全部添加」；改乱了点「恢复默认」。卡片多于一行时，下面左边有「收起 / 展开其余 N 张」，收起后只留第一行，把最想看的拖到第一行就行。可选的小卡有：": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You choose which cards sit at the bottom and in what order. On the Dashboard, press and hold a card until it lifts, then drag it where you want it. Tap a card (except Month), or “Edit Cards” below them, to open the editor: the cards on your Dashboard are at the top; tap the minus on the left to remove one, or drag the handle on the right to reorder. Removed cards move down to “More Cards”; tap the plus to add one back, or tap “Add All”. If things get messy, tap “Reset to Default”. When the cards take more than one row, “Show less / Show N more” appears at the bottom left; collapsed, only the first row stays, so drag your favorites there. The cards you can choose from:"
          }
        }
      }
    },
