    "房、车这类一时卖不掉的可以不计入，只留在净值里。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Things you can't sell quickly, like a home or a car, can be left out and kept in net worth only."
