    "房租、房贷、会员": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Rent, mortgage, subscriptions"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "房租、水电、会员…": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Rent, utilities, subscriptions…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "房租、水电、会员这类固定支出加在这里。\n到日子自动记一笔，自由天数会提前留出这笔钱。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Add fixed expenses like rent, utilities and subscriptions here.\nThey're recorded on their dates, and Freedom Days sets the money aside in advance."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "房租、水电、会员，到日子自动记账": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Rent, utilities, subscriptions, recorded on their dates"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "房租、订阅按到期日自动扣，自由天数不再跳水": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Rent and subscriptions come out on their due dates, so Freedom Days no longer plunges"
