    "资产可以拆成「房」「定期」「基金」各一项，现金可以拆成「微信」「支付宝」「招行卡」各一个账户。新加一项时，先选钱从哪来：": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Assets can be split into items like “Home”, “Deposits” and “Funds”, and cash into accounts like “Checking”, “Card” and “Wallet”. When you add one, first choose where the money comes from:"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "资产和现金怎么办": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "What About Assets and Cash"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "资产和现金拆成子账户后，每一个都能单独选计不计入自由天数。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Once assets and cash are split into sub-accounts, each one can count in Freedom Days or not."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "资产和现金有什么区别": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Assets vs. cash"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "资产已经拆成多项，请在资产明细里修改。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Assets are split into items. Edit them in the item list."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "资产总数会少 ¥%@。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Total assets will drop by ¥%@."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "资产总额 ¥%@ 保持不变。合并后无法恢复原来的拆分，之后解锁 Pro 需要重新拆分。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Total assets stay at ¥%@. The split can't be restored after merging; if you unlock Pro later, you'll split again."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "资产或现金都算，记完再记一笔支出": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Assets or cash both count. Then add an expense"
