      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "All assets"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "资产是定期、股票这类不打算马上花的钱，现金是随时能花的。\n点一行改金额；资产前面的方格，管它算不算进自由天数。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Assets are money you won't spend soon, like deposits and stocks; cash is what you can spend any time.\nTap a row to change it; the square next to assets decides whether they count in Freedom Days."
          }
        }
      }
    },
