          }
        }
      }
    },
    "钱包页回到经典样式。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The Assets page goes back to the Classic style."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "钱包页面": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Assets page"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "钱包（资产与现金）": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Assets & Cash"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "钱在资产和现金之间挪，用调拨。比如拿活期买了基金：从现金调到资产。调拨只换位置，**净值不变**。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "To move money between assets and cash, use a transfer. Bought a fund with checking money? Transfer from cash to assets. A transfer only moves money; **net worth stays the same**."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "钱在资产和现金之间挪，用调拨，净值不变。\n点这一行展开。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Move money between assets and cash with a transfer; net worth stays the same.\nTap this row to open it."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "银卡": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Silver Card"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "长按拖动调整顺序，左滑删除。点一个分类可以改名，或把它的账全部移到别的分类。删除分类不影响已记的账。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Touch and hold to drag into order; swipe left to delete. Tap a category to rename it or move all its entries to another one. Deleting a category doesn't change past entries."
          }
        }
      }
    },
